{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/titleBand.png?t=1742137219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The world is dying, and all you can do in this game is 'press the right-Arrow button'!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Save the world using only 2 buttons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/witch_idle.png?t=1742137219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this game, you're a witch in a pocket.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Naturally, there's not much you can do in this state!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You can only use the right arrow key to 'teleport' forward or</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/play.gif?t=1742137219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>return with the 'R' button.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/savePoint.gif?t=1742137219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eh... that's it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sounds too easy, right? Well, why don't you give it a try?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406610/extras/dead.gif?t=1742137219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It might be harder than you think!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You can aim for a 'One Click' finish,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>or you can try to collect a vari